A massive milestone in Spatial Intelligence!

Previously, reconstructing a room with photogrammetry or 3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) required hundreds of captures and hours of compute. With Meta's new SAM 3D fused with neural radiance:

📌 A single iPhone photo lets the AI infer hidden occlusions and depth geometry;
📌 Rendered in-browser with 3D Gaussian Splatting at smooth 90fps interactive speeds;
📌 Specular highlights, reflections, and roughness are preserved seamlessly for VR/AR.

