📌 Modify a core data model, and it silently synchronizes interface signatures across all referencing files without prompting;
📌 Built-in rollback snapshots: if test suites fail, it rewinds state and tries an alternate implementation pattern;
📌 Consumes 35% less memory than typical extension wrappers.

